{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/21/8555055/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、本当にみんなにびっくりされるくらい\n水やお茶をよく飲むの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外に食べ行ったりすると\n尚更よくお水を飲む！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと握手会も！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく分からないけど\n2Lくらい飲んでそうだな〜( ˘ω˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水沢山飲むと良いって聞くし\n多分、いいこと！( ˘ω˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！ChihAnswer！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/21/8555055/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ashley Westwoodさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ちーちゃんは小学生の頃とか、習い事してましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→バスケ、新体操、料理教室、バトン\nを習っていたよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新体操とか習っていたのに\n身体はもう人並みに堅くなりました( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/21/8555055/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"屋根裏の散歩者さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・何も考えずに出来るとしたらどんな髪型にしてみたいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ずーーっと昔から思ってるのは\n金髪ショートがしてみたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外国人風でカッコいいかなって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは、頑張ればできそうな\nインナーカラー！\n外は普通の茶髪や黒髪なのに\n中だけ少しカラーが入ってる髪型に\n凄い憧れる♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/21/8555055/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さとし@宅浪さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ちーちゃんはお母さん似？お父さん似？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→鼻から口元、そして笑い方が\nお母さんと瓜二つ！\n因みに妹もそっくり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"骨格はお父さん似！\n筋肉のつき方もお父さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目だけは誰の目か分からない。。\n私のひいおじいちゃんなんじゃないかっていう\n説も出てきている...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/21/8555055/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルトさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・好きな芸人さんはいますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→バナナマンさん、イジリーさんは\nもちろんの事、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きすぎて動画とかを\nずっと見ている芸人さんはハライチさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"直接見たくてお笑いライブにまで\n足を運んだ芸人さんはウーマンラッシュアワーさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと井戸の中からじゃなくて〜っていう\n芸が大好きでスタンプまで買った\n芸人さんは佐久間一行さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとあの美声を近くで聴きたい\nトレンディエンジェルの斎藤さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お笑い大好き！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/21/8555055/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー☆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ちーちゃんと同い年の俺は無理なんだけど、コーヒーはブラックで飲める派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→去年？放送された催眠術の回の乃木中で\n十文字先生に\nコーヒーを飲めるようになる！っていう\n解けない催眠術を\nいくちゃん、まあやと3人で\nかけてもらったら\nその時からコーヒーが飲めるようになったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その日に初めてブラックのコーヒーも\n飲めました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも中々自分ではブラックは買わないから\nその日以来飲んでないから分かんないけど\n飲もうと思ったら飲める！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それまではコーヒー牛乳も\n飲めなかったのに\n今ではカフェオレとか大好きになった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/21/8555055/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょーよーさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ズバリ！アンダーライブ中国シリーズの見所は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→雰囲気や空気感、世界観！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までとは違う空気感に\n是非のまれていってください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん質問有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部に返せないのが心苦しいんだけど...\nまた送ってくれたら嬉しいです(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「気づけよBaby」THE ORAL CIGARETTESさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞が熱くてカッコよくて\nとても好き！！\nそして演奏も好き〜\nカッコいい〜\nなんかとってもこの曲\nカッコよくて憧れる。\n声も普段聞いてるような高めの声ではないから\n低い声にもハッとする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然のグアム写真。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/21/8555055/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フローズンヨーグルト屋さんで\nみんなでの撮影オフショット！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べるの楽しみそうな顔してる(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/21/8555055/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとこれはフローズンヨーグルト屋さんのあと\nみんなでご飯を食べた時♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスティーが大きくて\nしかもめっちゃ甘かったのを覚えてる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日雨冷たくって\n凄い寒くって悲しくなった( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも可愛い傘と\n可愛いレインシューズで\n張り切って歩いてみた...！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台風よ...去れ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}